        <p>The Awards will be found in the atones of our success. Look for these stories. Seigel's Syrup Is an unfailing remedy for Indigestion and Liver Complaints. Miss M. J. BARTON, 56, Sorby- street, Sheffield, says '' After suffering for over two years from indigestion and an ulcerated stomach, I was completely cured by Seigel's Syrup.</p>
