        <head>HAPPY OLD AGE. %</head>
        <p>HAPPY OLD AGE. %</p>
        <p>Old age need not be unhappy, as the cxlerience of Mr siss Booth, of Honley Moore, neAr Huddersfield, proves. At the age nc sevonty he owes good health and happiness to D )dd's Kidney Pills, as does his wife, aged sixty-three years. Mr Booth suff-:red from the after-effects of influerz a. Be had terrible pains in the back, and was treated by a doctor, who Raid the kidneys were wrong. Rh treat- ment gave no relief, and Mr Booth's weakness increased so that he could not stoop. It was then he tried Dodd's Kidney Pills, and they cured him, for the Nit. in the back disappeared, and ho has had no further trouble since. For five years his wife suffered from pains in the blot:, and was so b4d that she could not get about. She took Dold'a Kidney Pills, and is also well again. and now able to get about with comfort. They were astonished by the rapid cures effected in both cases, and with thousands are thanking Dodd's Kidney Pills for a happy old age. D tild's Kidney Pills aro 23 91 per box, of all Chemists or post free on receipt of price by The Dodds Medicine Co, 23, F.rringdon-avenue, London, E.C. Remember he name, D-o-d-d-'s.</p>
