        <p>6-5 a.ca.</p>
        <p>Boating Fatality at Warrington.</p>
        <p>A boating fatality on the Mersey hen been re- ported to tne Warrington police. Private Halton, a young militiaman living at William-street, Wid- no., and Michael Shepherd cams up the river in a boat from Widnes and when near Atherton's ()ley the boat caps'zqd end both mAn were thrown into the water. Halton was drowned, and the other man was re6caed by William McClew, of Queen. street, Warrington. . - - -</p>
