        <p>The domestics of Chicago have formed a trade union to secure two hours off each afternoon, two evenings off each week, and permission "to enjoy club life." Gentlemen friends are to be allowed to visit the kitchen and on no account must the ensuing conversation he interrupted. Domestic ladies are to be allowed every facility to attend bargain sales. On Sunday afternoon an inmate of a private asylum at Wokingbam eluded the vigilance of his attendant and escaped into the streets. He created a sensation by running round the town in a state of nudity. Alter an exciting chase he was recntared near the Recreation Ground, where a large crowd had assembled to listen to the Town Band's Sunday concert. A pleasure steamer which left Bristol on Saturday night with 200 people for Cardiff,got ashore on the mud at the mouth mf the River Avon, and bad to wait one tide with the passengers on board her all night. They were put on another steamer on Sunday morning, and taken on to Cardiff,the pleasure, steamer being brought up to Bristol.</p>
